        "short_description": {
            "database_value": "KLINGER United Kingdom, officially known as KLINGER Ltd., is a leading provider of sealing solutions and joint integrity services. Established in 1923 and headquartered in Bradford, West Yorkshire, the company operates as a private limited entity and is part of the global KLINGER Group, which has a rich history dating back to 1886. KLINGER UK coordinates a network of six regional manufacturing and distribution facilities across the UK, ensuring efficient service delivery.\n\nThe company specializes in a wide range of services, including the design and supply of metallic and non-metallic gaskets, joint integrity management, and precision engineering. KLINGER UK is known for its \"Total Integrity Solution,\" which integrates engineering, design, and on-site support to enhance reliability and safety in critical industries. Its diverse client base spans sectors such as oil and gas, offshore wind energy, pharmaceuticals, and aerospace, making it a trusted partner for high-performance sealing and fluid control systems.",
            "ai_value": "World’s leading developer and manufacturer of quality sealing products, level gauges, valves, and integrity services."
